    "capability_check": "n",
    "uncertainty_reported": "n",
    "code_released": "not stated",
    "peer_reviewed": "Proceedings of the Sixth Workshop on NLP for Indigenous Languages of the Americas (AmericasNLP)",
    "problems": "The authors identify small task samples (n ∈ [9, 17]), English-centric NER and POS benchmarks, and the fact that Ben coincides with Bmax for every MT language. They characterize the R² values as descriptive, not evidence of out-of-sample predictive power.",
